@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

@prefix :     <urn:stklug84:MagicCardsOntology:2026-02-27#> .
@base         <urn:stklug84:MagicArenaSynergies:2026-07-19#> .

################################################################################
#
# Ontology Definition
#
################################################################################

<urn:stklug84:MagicArenaSynergies:2026-07-19#>
    rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/> ;
    owl:imports <urn:stklug84:MagicCardsOntology:2026-02-27#> ,
                <urn:stklug84:MagicCardIndividuals:2026-07-19#> ;
    rdfs:label "Magic Arena Synergies"@en ;
    rdfs:comment """An instance graph capturing directional synergy relations
(:amplifies, :enables and their OWL inverses) and mutual synergies
(:hasSynergyWith) between the card individuals of the MTG Arena collection
(MagicArenaCollection.ttl). A deck is built from the cards of the MTG Arena
collection or from those of the paper collection, never from both, so the
synergies of the two collections are kept apart: this graph relates only
cards the MTG Arena collection holds, MagicCardSynergies only cards the
paper collection holds. Each logical synergy is asserted exactly once:
directional relations use the forward properties, the inverse directions
follow from the owl:inverseOf axioms in MagicCardsOntology, and the
symmetric :hasSynergyWith is asserted once per pair. Relations are
deck-independent: they hold for any deck built from the collection. Where a
card exists in several printings, the relations are asserted on one
canonical individual per card name. This file imports MagicCardsOntology
for the property definitions and MagicCardIndividuals for the card
individuals it relates."""@en .

################################################################################
#
# MTG Arena Collection Card Synergies
#
# Directional and mutual synergies across the card individuals of the MTG
# Arena collection, MagicArenaCollection.ttl. The paper collection has its
# own synergy graph, MagicCardSynergies.ttl: the two collections are separate
# card pools, a deck is built from one of them, and each graph relates only
# the cards its collection holds. A card both collections hold has the same
# relations to the other cards both hold in either graph.
#
# The relations were derived mechanic by mechanic, as for the paper
# collection: every keyword action (rule 701), keyword ability (rule 702) and
# ability word (rule 207.2c) of the Comprehensive Rules, edition 2026-11-06,
# that appears on the collection's cards - among them the edition's new
# assimilate (701.72), beam me up (702.196), federation and strange new
# worlds, and facing a dilemma (700.17) - together with MTG Arena's
# digital-only mechanics (perpetual changes, seek, conjure, specialize,
# intensity, boons, spellbooks) and the themes those mechanics feed (tokens,
# counters, energy, artifacts, Equipment and Auras, Vehicles, Mounts and
# Spacecraft, graveyard, enters-the-battlefield, blink and copy effects,
# casting from exile, sacrifice and death, combat, spells, lands and mana,
# life, card draw, tribes and planeswalkers). Each pair was checked against
# both cards' Oracle text. Basic lands are not related.
#
# Modelling conventions:
#   :amplifies      - subject increases the value, frequency or magnitude of
#                     the object's abilities (trigger doublers, token/counter/
#                     energy multipliers, blink/copy engines re-firing ETBs).
#   :enables        - subject creates the preconditions for the object's
#                     payoff (resource producers feeding sinks, token
#                     producers feeding copy/populate payoffs, extra combats
#                     feeding attack triggers).
#   :hasSynergyWith - mutual synergy with no clear direction (stacking
#                     doublers, closed engine loops). Symmetric; asserted once
#                     per pair.
#
# Only the forward properties are asserted; :isAmplifiedBy and :isEnabledBy
# follow from the owl:inverseOf axioms in MagicCardsOntology, keeping each
# logical synergy asserted exactly once.
#
################################################################################

# --- Aang, Swift Savior // Aang and La, Ocean's Fury ---
:AangSwiftSavior :amplifies :CraftworkCrusher ,  # Airbend it and recast for {2}: choose two ETB modes again
                            :PossessedSkaab ,  # Airbended, it is recast for {2}: another regrowth
                            :RiddlemasterSphinx ,  # Its ETB airbends it; recast for {2}: another opposing creature bounced
                            :RuneScarredDemon ,  # Its ETB airbends it; recast for {2}: another tutor
                            :UldarosTheorix ,  # Airbended, he is recast for {2}: his cast-only ETB fires again
                            :WhiteDragon ,  # Its ETB airbends it; recast for {2}: another creature tapped and frozen
                            :WicksPatrol ,  # Airbended, it is recast for {2}: another mill three and -X/-X
                            :WildwoodEscort .  # Airbended, it is recast for {2}: another creature regrown
:AangSwiftSavior :enables :BiorganicCarapace .  # Aang and La's attack counters make every attacker modified

# --- Aatchik, Emerald Radian ---
:AatchikEmeraldRadian :enables :EsgarothGarrison ,  # Each Insect from the swarm adds a power
                               :GaladrielLightOfValinor ,  # It and X Insect tokens enter: all three Alliance modes
                               :InspiringCommander ,  # Each 1/1 Insect entering draws a card and gains 1 life
                               :RaucousEntertainer ,  # The whole Insect swarm entered this turn: a counter on each
                               :TheHungerTideRises .  # Its Insect swarm swells chapter IV's sacrifice: a bigger tutor

# --- Abrade ---
:AbradeMagicTheGatheringFoundations188 :enables :SevenOfNine .  # Burn-or-shatter mode choice draws a card

# --- Abyssal Harvester ---
:AbyssalHarvester :amplifies :Mulldrifter .  # Copies the evoked Mulldrifter from the yard: two more cards
:AbyssalHarvester :enables :ProftSinisterMastermind .  # Copies Proft the turn its ability bins it: a 5/5 without threshold

# --- Abzan Devotee ---
:AbzanDevotee :enables :AlongTheCrookedWay ,  # Each rebuy from the yard is a creature card leaving: amass 1
                       :ArniHumbleScribe ,  # Recurring loot fodder: loots never cost a real card
                       :AttunedHunter ,  # Rebuying it from the yard on your turn adds a +1/+1 counter
                       :EssenceAnchor ,  # Rebuy on your turn lets the Anchor make a 2/2 Zombie
                       :HallwayHeckler ,  # Recurring rummage fodder: rummages never cost a real card
                       :HardenedAcademic ,  # Each rebuy from the yard puts a +1/+1 counter on a creature
                       :IsolinearProcessor ,  # Recurring loot fodder: loots never cost a real card
                       :JalumTome ,  # Recurring loot fodder: loots never cost a real card
                       :MidnightReaper ,  # Rebuyable nontoken body: each of its deaths draws a card
                       :MistyKnightHeroForHire ,  # Recurring discard fodder: activations never cost a real card
                       :SpinnerOfSouls ,  # Rebuyable nontoken body: each of its deaths digs a creature
                       :VashFreelanceArchaeologist .  # Each Devotee return from the yard draws a card

# --- Accursed Witch // Infectious Curse ---
:AccursedWitch :enables :Bloombrute ,  # Curse gains you 1 each opponent upkeep: a card on their turn
                        :KwiaVigorbloom ,  # Curse gains you 1 each opponent upkeep: a Lotus on their turn
                        :TanglespanLookout .  # Returning Infectious Curse is an Aura you control entering: draw

